<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian central bank on Thursday said it had called for bids on one-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>Bids must be in by 1300 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bnak allotted 11.69 billion schilings in repos, or 12 percent of bids, also at a fixed rate of three percent. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
